      "content": "I'm not sure I understand the comparisons you're making. I need this for a formal technical report, so please avoid any metaphors and stick strictly to the engineering data. \n\nFocusing on the bitumen: can you explain the specific rheological changes during those diurnal cycles? I need to know how the shift from high-temperature fluidity to low-temperature brittleness specifically affects the tensile stress within the asphalt matrix in a Phoenix climate.",
